Retail Plus Lite recomp

The host is derived from the AmazingMIDI recomp's host (itself from the
MechWarrior 3 recomp's) and runs on pcrecomp's native32 runtime
(https://github.com/sp00nznet/pcrecomp); the lift driver is the Bully
recomp's. All MIT.

